WEBVTT

00:00:17.612 --> 00:00:19.197
I guess the party's this way.

00:00:35.755 --> 00:00:37.799
Let's get this party started right!

00:00:38.633 --> 00:00:39.634
All right!

00:00:39.801 --> 00:00:40.844
What?

00:00:44.055 --> 00:00:46.641
I thought they said
the party was this way.

00:01:13.168 --> 00:01:15.462
DJ in a clamshell?

00:01:16.046 --> 00:01:17.714
I'm so jealous.

00:02:04.719 --> 00:02:08.598
I can't believe my dad Zinged
with someone who's trying to kill him.

00:02:08.681 --> 00:02:11.267
Yeah, the Zing makes you do
crazy things.

00:02:11.351 --> 00:02:12.602
Really, Johnny?

00:02:12.936 --> 00:02:17.857
What's most important to understand
is that love is an infinite enigma

00:02:17.941 --> 00:02:20.068
that is beyond our understanding.

00:02:20.443 --> 00:02:23.571
You and I were two halves,
a world apart.

00:02:23.738 --> 00:02:26.699
But then we followed
the strands of destiny

00:02:26.783 --> 00:02:28.410
and were brought together.

00:02:28.493 --> 00:02:31.162
And our halves made one whole.

00:02:31.663 --> 00:02:33.623
But what if she and he...

00:02:33.706 --> 00:02:37.085
You must release all the negativity
and look within.

00:02:37.168 --> 00:02:39.212
Your bond is unbreakable.

00:02:41.381 --> 00:02:42.715
You're right, honey.

00:02:43.466 --> 00:02:44.509
Thanks.

00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:47.220
You sounded pretty smart, Dad.

00:02:47.303 --> 00:02:49.305
That? Yeah, it was just the philosophy

00:02:49.389 --> 00:02:51.975
of Sifu Sing from my favorite
TV show when I was a kid,

00:02:52.058 --> 00:02:53.726
Kung Fu Shaolin Monk Master.

00:02:53.810 --> 00:02:55.186
Anyways, let's get back to dancing!

00:02:55.437 --> 00:02:56.563
Cool.

00:03:00.775 --> 00:03:03.153
Dad? You have to talk to Ericka.

00:03:03.236 --> 00:03:04.654
-What?
-I know.

00:03:04.737 --> 00:03:08.533
I know what I said before,
but may be I overreacted a teensy bit.

00:03:08.992 --> 00:03:11.161
It's just the thought of losing you.

00:03:11.244 --> 00:03:14.330
What? What are you talking about,
losing me?

00:03:14.414 --> 00:03:16.499
Well, obviously, after you get married,

00:03:16.583 --> 00:03:18.334
you're gonna live on the ship
and travel around the world...

00:03:19.335 --> 00:03:20.962
Slow down, Mavis.

00:03:21.045 --> 00:03:23.131
There are two things I can promise you.

00:03:23.506 --> 00:03:29.053
One, nothing can ever take me
from you and all my family.

00:03:29.137 --> 00:03:32.265
Two, I will never live on a boat.

00:03:34.893 --> 00:03:37.395
You're my cute little tarantula.

00:03:37.479 --> 00:03:39.314
How could I ever leave you?

00:03:39.647 --> 00:03:41.566
Now, seriously, go talk to her.

00:03:41.649 --> 00:03:46.696
I can't. You heard what she said,
she could never be with someone like me.

00:03:46.779 --> 00:03:48.865
No, Dad. You're just a half,

00:03:48.948 --> 00:03:52.160
and you have to follow
your destiny to find an infinite whole.

00:03:52.577 --> 00:03:54.204
You sound like Johnny.

00:03:54.662 --> 00:03:57.040
Point is, you can't deny a Zing.

00:03:57.248 --> 00:03:59.751
Monster, human, unicorn...

00:03:59.834 --> 00:04:01.044
It doesn't matter.

00:04:01.878 --> 00:04:04.005
So go to her! Now!

00:04:05.673 --> 00:04:07.050
Okay. I'm on it.

00:04:08.676 --> 00:04:10.094
Hey, man, you're not allowed up here.

00:04:10.178 --> 00:04:11.554
The DJ booth is a sacred space.

00:04:19.812 --> 00:04:21.606
No. Tinkles, quiet.

00:04:21.814 --> 00:04:22.815
Who is this?

00:04:23.358 --> 00:04:27.612
I know you recognize me,
your greatest rival.

00:04:28.863 --> 00:04:30.406
Right.

00:04:30.615 --> 00:04:33.493
You own that Holiday Inn
down by the airport.

00:04:33.743 --> 00:04:38.081
No! It is I, Abraham Van Helsing.

00:04:38.581 --> 00:04:39.791
Van Helsing?

00:04:39.874 --> 00:04:41.501
After all these years?

00:04:41.751 --> 00:04:43.586
You look awful.

00:04:44.879 --> 00:04:47.257
Always with the quick insults.

00:04:47.840 --> 00:04:50.176
Well, this will shut you up.

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:51.928
And all monsters.

00:04:53.221 --> 00:04:55.974
That's just Ericka's
family heirloom thingy.

00:04:57.058 --> 00:04:58.601
Good one, Ericka.

00:04:58.851 --> 00:04:59.936
Ericka?

00:05:00.103 --> 00:05:01.604
You fool.

00:05:01.688 --> 00:05:06.317
Not only is she the ship's captain,
but she also happens to be...

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:11.072
Wait. You tell him.

00:05:12.865 --> 00:05:15.451
I'm his great-granddaughter.

00:05:16.869 --> 00:05:19.038
I'm Ericka Van Helsing.

00:05:20.331 --> 00:05:22.458
I knew there was something wrong
with her.

00:05:22.542 --> 00:05:23.543
But...

00:05:24.794 --> 00:05:26.170
See, what happened...

00:05:26.629 --> 00:05:30.592
Now that we're all caught up,
let's get back to the dying.

00:05:31.467 --> 00:05:36.472
Behold, the key to the demise
of all monsters.

00:05:49.360 --> 00:05:50.653
Let's see.

00:05:50.737 --> 00:05:52.780
Right... Okay.

00:05:56.743 --> 00:06:00.330
Listen to the melody
of your destruction.

00:06:03.958 --> 00:06:05.918
What's this little doodad do?

00:06:07.587 --> 00:06:08.838
Yeah!

